07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=axTzbtDrasQQ7kNvwGH6nyI&_nc_oc=AdpqVx53TlYR6aflXE5oF9jxZpNzXoOFNzH1BF_dXmXoIB3sP7FOYl6pFi1DpkdQ5ig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRvWfA-mz0H4_tLVx2vC3paSUAL5EOlTnJV3PchkNtwhQ&oe=6AEDE1C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CwviialafosQ7kNvwH7vLXN&_nc_oc=AdrHOMOZnRIdhQgOwvBLmrR29BkyHjUUz4GLw2iUCwxF9scCwIAmejEdWZWbKysvQWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRKnin5kjGPzH4UoBkkh5X6PuWS6TD-ZSLrJIGUHlb92g&oe=6AEDD73F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OXfP9qPxAg8Q7kNvwFACB4H&_nc_oc=AdqNPnKMejoQppIQ8g1upJtXMMhttaEC00cFyKda6yTWSu21SORuRLTgtbwB3rXoHh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXG5gbbj5vpf26P174m7JWGxAyuq4w7cgtEcyTYAMQQg&oe=6AEDE630"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic